                        <h3 id="ukraine-hits-lukoil-gas-processing-plant-and-oil-facility-deep-inside-russia">Ukraine hits Lukoil gas processing plant and oil facility deep inside Russia</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/09/isw-putin-admits-ukraine-is-striking-refineries-but-claims-it-wont-help/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="isw-putin-admits-ukraine-is-striking-refineries-but-claims-it-wont-help">ISW: Putin admits Ukraine is striking refineries but claims it “won’t help”</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
