                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/04/another-refinery-attack-another-fire-kinef-refinery-ablaze-in-leningrad-oblast-drone-strike-video/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="another-refinery-attack-another-fire-kinef-refinery-ablaze-in-leningrad-oblast-drone-strike-video-updated">Another refinery attack, another fire: Kinef refinery ablaze in Leningrad Oblast drone strike (video, updated)</h3>
                      </a>
