                        <h3 id="europes-self-sabotage-seven-eu-countries-increase-russian-energy-imports-while-supporting-ukraine-reuters">Europe’s “self-sabotage”: Seven EU countries increase Russian energy imports while supporting Ukraine – Reuters</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/10/estonia-latvia-lithuania-plan-mass-evacuations-in-case-of-russian-attack-reuters/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="estonia-latvia-lithuania-plan-mass-evacuations-in-case-of-russian-attack-reuters">Estonia, Latvia, Lithuania plan mass evacuations in case of Russian attack – Reuters</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                          </ul>
          </div>
      </div>
    


<p></p>



<p></p>

